# SHG Member ID Card Photo Automation - Implementation Plan (Semi-Automated)

## Goal Description
Create a "Co-pilot" script. The User handles Login and Group Selection. The Script automates the repetitive "Member Detail -> Process Photo -> Update" loop.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Workflow Change**: Script assumes User has already opened a Group Member List.
> **Background Removal**: Will use `rembg` library to change background to white. This is computationally heavier but effective.
> **Right-Side Download**: Script will strictly download the **Right-Side** image as requested.

## Proposed Changes

### Project Structure

#### [MODIFY] [requirements.txt](file:///d:/New%20folder/requirements.txt)
- Add `rembg`, `onnxruntime` (for rembg).

#### [MODIFY] [main.py](file:///d:/New%20folder/main.py)
- **Remove**: Login, Navigation, Filter logic.
- **Add**: "Wait for User Ready" prompt.
- **Implement**: `process_current_group()` loop.
- **Logic**:
  1. Launch Browser (or attach).
  2. Pause "Please Navigate to a Group List and press Enter".
  3. `browser.get_all_members_in_list()`
  4. Loop:
     - `browser.open_member(index)`
     - `browser.download_right_image()`
     - `image_processor.process(image_path)` (Resize + White BG)
     - `browser.upload_image(processed_path)`
     - `browser.go_back_to_list()`
  5. Pause "Group Done. Select next group and press Enter".

#### [MODIFY] [browser_handler.py](file:///d:/New%20folder/browser_handler.py)
- **Focus**: Interaction within the Member List and Member Detail pages.
- **New Methods**:
  - `get_member_count()`
  - `click_member_view(index)`
  - `click_download_right()`
  - `upload_file(path)`
  - `click_back_button()`

#### [MODIFY] [image_processor.py](file:///d:/New%20folder/image_processor.py)
- **Update**: Add Background Removal logic (`rembg`).
- **Standard**: 300x400px, White Background.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Test `image_processor` locally with a sample image to ensure Background Removal works and output is 300x400.

### Manual Verification
- Run script. User logs in. User selects "Rural... Endiyur".
- Script processes 1 member. User verifies the uploaded photo looks correct (White BG, resized).
